---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Platform Fee Calculators | MathMyRate" description="Estimate platform and processing fees for a sale, and what the sale really pays you." ogImage="/og/fees.png">
  <main id="main-content" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24">
    <p class="eyebrow">Platform fees</p>
    <h1 class="display mt-4 max-w-3xl text-5xl font-bold leading-none md:text-6xl">Know what a sale<br />really pays you.</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/70">Fee tools are built only for documented, sourced scenarios. When a case is unsupported, the tool says so plainly instead of guessing a rate.</p>
    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
      <a href="/fees/stripe-fee-calculator/" class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-line bg-[#fafbfd] p-8 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1"><p class="eyebrow">01 / Card processing</p><h2 class="display mt-5 text-3xl font-bold">Stripe fee calculator</h2><p class="mt-4 text-ink/65">US standard online card pricing: the fee, what you keep, and what to charge to hit a target.</p><span class="mt-8 block font-semibold text-navy">Open calculator →</span></a>
      <a href="/fees/paypal-fee-calculator/" class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-line bg-[#fafbfd] p-8 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1"><p class="eyebrow">02 / Wallet checkout</p><h2 class="display mt-5 text-3xl font-bold">PayPal fee calculator</h2><p class="mt-4 text-ink/65">Checkout's PayPal payment method: the fee, what you keep, and what to charge to hit a target.</p><span class="mt-8 block font-semibold text-navy">Open calculator →</span></a>
      <a href="/fees/gumroad-fee-calculator/" class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-line bg-[#fafbfd] p-8 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1"><p class="eyebrow">03 / Digital marketplace</p><h2 class="display mt-5 text-3xl font-bold">Gumroad fee calculator</h2><p class="mt-4 text-ink/65">Direct sales versus Discover marketplace sales, with the documented volume threshold.</p><span class="mt-8 block font-semibold text-navy">Open calculator →</span></a>
      <a href="/fees/lemon-squeezy-fee-calculator/" class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-line bg-[#fafbfd] p-8 transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1"><p class="eyebrow">04 / Digital products</p><h2 class="display mt-5 text-3xl font-bold">Lemon Squeezy fee calculator</h2><p class="mt-4 text-ink/65">Order fees for the documented domestic card scenario, with payout costs kept separate.</p><span class="mt-8 block font-semibold text-navy">Open calculator →</span></a>
    </div>
    <section class="mt-14 max-w-3xl border-t border-line pt-10"><h2 class="display text-3xl font-bold">Sourced scenarios only</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-ink/70">Each fee tool is limited to the account market, currency, product, and channel its official source documents. Anything outside that scope is labeled unsupported, never filled in with a guessed rate.</p></section>
  </main>
</Layout>
